  "about": [
    "Household measures for rows of a table that publishes none. Livsmedelsverket (slv) has no piece, serving or spoon weights, so Describe a meal had to guess what '2 boiled eggs' weigh.",
    "Each weight is copied from the same food in Matvaretabellen 2026 (Mattilsynet), named in 'from', and reviewed by hand: same food, same state (raw, boiled, fried).",
    "The piece is the medium size where Matvaretabellen gives one (apple, potato), otherwise Matvaretabellen's own piece. Its other sizes, slices, wedges and decilitres become measures; its portion becomes the serving.",
    "A row gets its measures only while its name is still the one listed here. A rename leaves it without, until it is reviewed again.",
    "Livsmedelsverket's own weight report (PM 2024, Volymvikter, viktförändringsfaktorer och avfall) was checked first. It has no whole egg, fruit or potato."
  ],
